sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Equipment as Equipment
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Equipment: updateCondition(condition, note)
    Note over Equipment: Policies: equipmentRead, equipmentWrite, equipmentExecute
    Note over Equipment: Guards (2)
    Equipment->>Equipment: guard[0]: self.registeredAt != null
    Equipment->>Equipment: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Equipment->>Equipment: compute.previousCondition
    Equipment->>Equipment: mutate.condition
    Equipment->>Equipment: mutate.conditionNote
    Equipment->>EventBus: emit EquipmentConditionUpdated on equipment.condition_updated
    Equipment-->>-Client: void